---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact ExactSize"
  description="Contact ExactSize about a correction, broken source link, accessibility issue, or question about the site."
  path="/contact/"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lede">Found a broken link or an outdated requirement? Send a note and include the page URL so it is easier to check.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:periscopebookeeping@gmail.com">periscopebookeeping@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p>You can also write with an accessibility issue, a tool problem, or a suggestion. For a tool problem, mention your browser and device if you can.</p>
      <p>Please do not email passport photos, identity documents, application forms, or other sensitive files. The tools are intended to process images locally in your browser; sending a file by email is separate from using the site.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
